{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6591061a-358d-876a-b08a-db7beffa7a4d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T10:47:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rocco Mancini",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:44:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:45:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I am calling about streetlight. It is flickering, on and off, all night. Is very annoying and maybe not safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:45:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can take that down. What's the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:45:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fifty-two Memorial Boulevard. The pole is in front of the house, near the curb, on Easton's Beach side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:45:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fifty-two Memorial Boulevard, got it. And it's flickering all night, not just going out completely?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:45:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, flickering. On, off, on, off. Whole night. Last night also, and the night before. [pause] Sorry, I am on speakerphone, can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:45:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Do you know if there's a number on the pole? Sometimes there's a little tag on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:45:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did not look. I can go outside and check. One moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:45:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:45:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] There is a small metal tag, but numbers are very faded. I cannot read."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:46:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, the address will do. Have you reported this before, maybe through the city's app?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:46:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I tried app first. But I was locked out. I had to answer security questions, many questions, and then it still did not let me in. So I call you instead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:46:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ugh, sorry about that. Phone's fine, I can put it in for you right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:46:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I would like crew to come and check the pole. Maybe is the bulb, maybe is wiring. I do not know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:46:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, they'll look at the whole fixture. I'll send it over as a flickering light at fifty-two Memorial Boulevard, crew to inspect the pole. Do you want a call back if they need anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:46:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. My number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-eight-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:46:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-eight-four. Perfect. With the holiday week it may take a few days for them to get out there, but it's in the queue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:47:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A few days is fine. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:47:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T10:47:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
